# Release / ASO memory

Full playbook: **`AGENTS.md` §4 (i18n) and §6 (screenshots & store preview)**.

## Hard gotchas

- In-app `ne` (Nepali) ≠ ASC locale — never push `ne` store metadata.
- Map: `en`→`en-US`, `es`→`es-ES`, `fr`→`fr-FR`, `pt`→`pt-PT`, plus `en-GB`, `hi`.
- `asc metadata validate` locally; **push / screenshot upload only when human asks**.
- Legal privacy/terms on **codse-website** must be deployed before App Review URLs work.
- Headless shots: `Documents/shot-route.txt` allowlist in `app/_layout.tsx`; Xcode-beta may need `DEVELOPER_DIR` + simctl (no Simulator.app).
- IPHONE_65 = 1242×2688; framed output under `screenshots/fancy/iphone65/{lang}/`.
- Brand: cream `#FFFCF9`, ochre `#B8953F` — not generic purple/AI cream themes.

## When changing strings

`en.json` first → all locale JSON → `t()` callers → `feat(i18n): …` commit.
